window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Wake up, go to school, come home, sleep, repeat.</p> <p>Smile, be happy, fit in…</p> <p>To an outsider, I live the perfect life. Big house, elite school, fancy car, and a doting father.</p> <p>Too bad it’s all a lie.</p> <p>No one knows my secrets and no one ever will.</p> <p>Tucker Kingsley hates me for what I did to him two years ago and he’ll try his best to destroy me, but you can’t break what’s already broken.</p> <p><b><i>Vengeful Sins is an all new dark bully romance and second book in the Wicked Elite series but can be read as a standalone.</i></b></p>"; 
